  "question": {
    "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub></math> for HCN is <math><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup></math> at <math><mn>25</mn><mo>°</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> . For maintaining a constant pH of 9, the volume in ml of 5 M KCN solution required to be added to 10 ml of 2 M HCN solution is",
