  "solution": {
    "text": "Suppose, volume of KCN added = x ml<br />Total volume of solution after mixing = (10 + x) ml<br />Molarity of HCN in the final solution<br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math><br />Molarity of HCN in the final solution<br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math><br />pH <math><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi mathvarian